Project Name: Pathly
Purpose: Automatic travel route generation web service

[Tech Stack]
- Next.js (App Router)
- React
- TypeScript
- Tailwind CSS
- Gemini API (AI route generation)
- Google Maps API (map display)

[Core Features]
1. User Input
   - Destination city
   - Travel dates (start ~ end)
   - Budget (budget/moderate/luxury)
   - Travel style (sightseeing/food/activities/relaxed)

2. AI Route Generation
   - Generate itinerary via Gemini API
   - Daily timeline
   - Time, budget, description for each location

3. Result Display
   - Left: Daily timeline
   - Right: Google Maps route
   - Detail popup on location click

[Folder Structure]
- /app: Pages
- /components: Reusable components
- /lib: API integration, utils
- /types: TypeScript types

[Design Guidelines]
- Clean, minimal UI
- Mobile responsive
- Fast loading with smooth animations